<title>USA: Diametrics Medical signs supply agreement.</title>
<headline>Diametrics Medical signs supply agreement.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diametrics Medical Inc said Thursday it signed an exclusive one-year supply contract with the University HealthSystem Consortium.</p>
<p>Under terms of the agreement, Diametrics will be the sole supplier of portable arterial blood gas/electrolyte analyzers to all consortium members.</p>
<p>University HealthSystems is a consortium of academic health centers whose members' combined purchasing volume for materials and supplies is greater than $1.7 billion annually.</p>
<p>Diametrics develops critical care technology.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
